  "question": {
    "text": "The diagram shows a spherical surface which separates two media of refractive indices,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>, respectively. Now, a point object is placed on the principal axis as shown in the figure. Then<br />\r<br />\r<img height=\"98\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/nbvrpvpswhzcgrzvmexudqcshgluooiujnkoyzkfjvxovhxxkb.jpeg\" width=\"205\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZluJp",
      "text": "Real image will form if  <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and for all values of  <math><mi>u</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
