      "text": "Real image for some values of  <math><mi>u</mi></math>  if  <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1GBvi",
      "text": "Virtual image will form if <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ctEh4",
      "text": "Virtual image will form if <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
